{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"难堪没让他少喜欢，可再多给一点，也证明不了自己什么都不求。\",\n      \"key\": \"多给一点\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼被珍惜，却不再反复看对方在不在意，也不逼自己什么都不求，就按眼下的心意关心对方，也盼对方过得好。\",\n      \"key\": \"仍盼被珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"关心对方时，他觉得这份喜欢留在心里也很甜，暂时忘了自己为何盼回应，可那念头过会儿又回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"留在心里也很甜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得眼前的亲近就这样过去，却怕它留不住，心里便泛起酸楚。\",\n      \"key\": \"怕它留不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R24\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的“解不开矛盾”改成具体发现：再多给一点，也证明不了自己什么都不求；难堪并没有让他少喜欢。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\", \"R26\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补明\",\n      \"why\": \"合并停止自我检查与转向眼前关心的行动。本轮明确他仍盼被珍惜，只是不再反复查看对方是否在意，也不逼自己变成什么都不求的人，同时保留真心关心对方、盼对方过得好的意思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R27\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-3\", \"S06-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-3保留独自珍藏喜欢的甜意，以及回应念头暂时退去又回来的变化；S06-4补足舍不得亲近、又怕它留不住的酸楚。这样既照顾B3，也保留这份甜意只能暂时让他放下回应的事实，为后段喜欢加深、变得难以收放留下原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"B4与B1主体验属于不同的听法，不能据此把感官沉醉、身体幻想或具体回忆写成他的实际经历，因此不强行补入。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "852745d8-4ee5-4fd7-b7d9-d9d72b3a9649", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223459565587Z", "elapsed_seconds": 311.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:40:11.464254+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "72847f04c52725a6e4f123a2ef4f4c7bd9d2d57cbd64ea36c731ff28a03e2483", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223459565587Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f4b10821738ab5abd71cb714dfe7d04132b126b50e1e030f347db9ee14600f62"}}}
